---
/**
 * Web3Forms redirects here after a successful contact-form submission (the
 * `redirect` hidden field on /contact points to this URL). It is a plain,
 * 0-JS confirmation screen and is kept out of the search index.
 */
import ContentPage from '../../components/ContentPage.astro';
---

<ContentPage
	slug="/contact/thanks"
	title="Message Sent — JSON Beam"
	description="Your message has been sent to the JSON Beam team. Thanks for reaching out — we'll get back to you soon."
	breadcrumbLabel="Message sent"
	h1="Message sent."
	intro="Thanks for reaching out — your message is on its way to us. We read every message and aim to reply within a few business days."
	noindex
>
	<h2>What happens next</h2>
	<p>
		We’ll get back to you by email at the address you provided. In the meantime, you can head
		back to the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> or jump straight into the tools — there’s
		nothing to install and nothing to sign up for.
	</p>
	<p>
		If your message was a bug report, thank you: clear, reproducible reports are the fastest way
		to get a fix shipped. While you’re here, the <a href="/json-formatter/">formatter</a> and
		<a href="/json-validator/">validator</a> are a click away.
	</p>
</ContentPage>
